The SVG files in this directory are Microsoft Fluent Emoji ("Color" style), taken unmodified from
https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji (assets/<Name>/Color/<name>_color.svg) and renamed after the
Passless item type each one marks:

  login.svg            Key                     secure_note.svg       Memo
  credit_card.svg      Credit card             identity.svg          Identification card
  password.svg         Old key                 ssh_key.svg           Laptop
  bank_account.svg     Money bag               passport.svg          Globe with meridians
  driver_license.svg   Automobile              wifi.svg              Antenna bars
  api_credential.svg   Gear                    server.svg            Desktop computer
  database.svg         File cabinet            email.svg             Envelope
  router.svg           Satellite antenna       software_license.svg  Ticket
  crypto_wallet.svg    Coin

